@startuml
' So do 7: KB2 - cookie bi danh cap bi phat hien va thu hoi
title KB2 - Infostealer lay cookie phien cua giang vien

actor "Giang vien" as gv
actor "Ke tan cong" as atk
participant "app" as a
database "sessions" as s
database "audit_log" as log
actor "Admin" as ad

gv -> a : dang nhap + OTP
a -> s : session S1 (mfa_verified = true)\nfingerprint = SHA256("Chrome/Win" + IP_gv)
a --> gv : cookie sg_token (HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict, 15 phut)

note over gv, atk
  Malware tren may GV doc cookie store
  va gui cookie ra ngoai (ClickFix / infostealer).
  Cookie HttpOnly chan JS doc, nhung khong chan
  malware doc file profile cua trinh duyet.
end note

atk -> a : GET /api/me\nCookie sg_token (hop le)\nUser-Agent "curl/8.0", IP khac
a -> a : chu ky JWT dung, session S1 con hieu luc
a -> a : fingerprint(req) != S1.fingerprint
a -> s : UPDATE S1 SET revoked_at = now(),\nrevoke_reason = 'CONTEXT_MISMATCH'
a -> log : SESSION_CONTEXT_MISMATCH (CRITICAL)
a --> atk : 401 SESSION_CONTEXT_MISMATCH

gv -> a : thao tac tiep theo bang cookie cu
a --> gv : 401 SESSION_REVOKED -> UI tu chuyen ve login

note over a
  Ngay khi fingerprint khop (ke tan cong gia dung
  User-Agent), viec sua diem van can X-OTP tu
  dien thoai GV -> 401 STEP_UP_REQUIRED.
end note

ad -> a : GET /api/admin/alerts
a --> ad : SESSION_CONTEXT_MISMATCH (CRITICAL)
ad -> a : POST /api/admin/users/:id/revoke-sessions (+ X-OTP)
ad -> a : POST /api/admin/users/:id/reset-mfa (+ X-OTP)
a -> log : ADMIN_REVOKE_SESSIONS, ADMIN_RESET_MFA (HIGH)
ad -> a : loc GRADE_UPDATE cua GV trong 24 gio\nxac nhan tung thay doi
@enduml
